{"id":"odu-teardown-crash","parent":"oduc-runs","ord":"a1","title":"Investigate: a lost ssh connection kills the whole odu run at teardown","done":"2026-08-29T12:16:00-04:00","desc":"The human's word, 2026-08-29 (~11:38): dispatch an agent to investigate with evidence. Observed by the #427 CI watcher: kolu-ci-9's ssh keep-alive dropped mid-e2e and odu's teardown crashed with repeated uncaught `logTail: append after log ended` exceptions for finished nodes — the whole live run died (history lost, rerun target gone), instead of the one node erroring. Deliverable: root cause with evidence, reported to the orchestrator; no issue or PR without the human's further word.","created":"2026-08-29T11:39:30-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T16:54:06-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/odu-teardown-crash.md","dispatched":"2026-08-29T11:39:00-04:00","terminal":"8be497af","worktree":".worktrees/investigate-teardown-crash"}}
{"id":"odu-teardown-fix","parent":"oduc-runs","ord":"a2","title":"PR: a transport death errors one node — sealed logs are never appended to, and the catch cannot kill the coordinator","done":"2026-08-29T13:31:47-04:00","desc":"Dispatched on the human's word 2026-08-29 ~12:17, to the SAME grok that root-caused it (warm context, its report in briefs/odu-teardown-crash.md): guard the append arm with isEnded the way stampTruncated already does; make attachLogs' catch unable to throw; die()-first ordering as race hardening. The repro becomes the regression test where the harness allows.\n\n**MERGE AUTHORIZATION STANDING** (the human, 2026-08-29 13:06, \"approved on green CI\"): the orchestrator merges without a further ask once the opus re-verdict clears the two MUSTs (the hang path, the untested guard, the burst shape) and the repo's CI is green at the final head — the verdict read from GitHub, never an agent's claim.","created":"2026-08-29T12:18:11-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T16:54:06-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","approved":"2026-08-29T13:06:00-04:00","brief":"briefs/odu-teardown-crash.md","dispatched":"2026-08-29T12:18:00-04:00","merge":"merge-human","musts":"2","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/odu/pull/93","reviewer":"agent-claude-opus","terminal":"8be497af","tier":"ordinary","timings":"implement 23m (grok) · review 7m (opus) · address 16m (grok) · re-verdict+residual 8m · ci 19m (claude-ci, GHA + dogfood) · close <1m — TOTAL 1h13m (12:18→13:31)","worktree":".worktrees/investigate-teardown-crash"}}
