{"id":"lane-oge-address","parent":"odu-green-exit-nonzero","ord":"a7","title":"address findings","done":"2026-08-31T17:47:27-04:00","started":"2026-08-31T17:41:50-04:00","worked":764,"after":["lane-oge-review"],"created":"2026-08-31T17:17:21-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T17:47:27-04:00"}
{"id":"odu-wait-settle-short","parent":"oduc-agent","ord":"a1","title":"odu: `wait --settle` returns before the run settles","doing":true,"started":"2026-09-01T08:22:05-04:00","desc":"Observed while dogfooding odu on its own PR: the CLI's `odu wait --settle` came back after about fifteen seconds saying `{\\\"settled\\\": false, \\\"passed\\\": false}` with exit code 1 — no reason given, no fail-fast, no timeout, no cancellation — while the run was demonstrably still going, lanes still leased and phases still running.\n\nThe MCP path did the right thing against that same live run: `wait_for_settle` blocked properly and returned the true verdict when it settled. So the two paths disagree, and the CLI is the one that lies.\n\nWhy it matters: a caller that trusts the CLI's answer reads a healthy run as an unsettled failure — which is the same class of false signal as the exit-code bug this run was pinning. Worth looking for a stray short-circuit in the CLI path that the MCP verb does not share.\n\n**QUEUED, AND IT SHIPS WITH THE RETRY DESCRIPTION (the human, 2026-08-31 ~20:45):** this and `odu-mcp-rerun-doc` are ONE PR, not two lanes — one story, told twice: the CLI lies about settling, and the retry verb never says what it does. Auto-merge. First in the overnight queue, dispatched when the appliance fold merges (the human ruled strictly one lane at a time). Both platforms green is the bar for odu, ruled the same evening.","see":["odu-mcp-rerun-doc"],"created":"2026-08-31T18:02:07-04:00","changed":"2026-09-01T09:08:00-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-claude-opus","brief":"briefs/odu-wait-settle.md","dispatched":"2026-09-01T08:18:00-04:00","from":"the CI watcher on odu#95's run, 2026-08-31 — reported as a harness note, unrelated to that PR","kolu-terminal":"f1752950","merge":"merge-auto","odu-worktree":".worktrees/odu-wait-settle","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/odu/pull/96","repo":"repo-odu","tier":"design-heavy"}}
